    {
      "subId": "7307418",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the designated location to look for clues about Ashvattha's Concourses",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730741801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730741801": {
            "id": "730741801",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We now have the second Vasoma Fruit!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741802"
            ]
          },
          "730741802": {
            "id": "730741802",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Impressive! Nara {NICKNAME} is not afraid of Marana and even drove all the monsters away. No wonder you could defeat Vanagni!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741803"
            ]
          },
          "730741803": {
            "id": "730741803",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, the many adventures we've been through aren't just for show, y'know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741804"
            ]
          },
          "730741804": {
            "id": "730741804",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#That's great! Then Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon must have many memories and stories, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741807"
            ]
          },
          "730741807": {
            "id": "730741807",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#I see. If you don't mind, we'd love to hear Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon's stories sometime.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741808"
            ]
          },
          "730741808": {
            "id": "730741808",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sure! We've shared our stories with others before, though it feels like so long ago...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741809"
            ]
          },
          "730741809": {
            "id": "730741809",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Speaking of which, Paimon saw a giant purple tree in the distance while we were in the Vasara Tree's dream. Paimon's pretty sure we saw it in Vanarana, too. What was that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741810"
            ]
          },
          "730741810": {
            "id": "730741810",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "That's the very first Ashvattha's Tree of Dreams. Hmm, how should I put this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741811"
            ]
          },
          "730741811": {
            "id": "730741811",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Dreams are like leaves in a stream. They soon float away with the water. If you want to keep a dream in place, you have to let it grow roots. That way, the dream won't drift away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741812"
            ]
          },
          "730741812": {
            "id": "730741812",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Hmm... it's so hard to explain..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7307401",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arama",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730740101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730740101": {
            "id": "730740101",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Greetings, Nara {NICKNAME}, Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740102"
            ]
          },
          "730740102": {
            "id": "730740102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's good to see you again, Arama! Who's the Aranara with you...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740103"
            ]
          },
          "730740103": {
            "id": "730740103",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "♪~",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740104"
            ]
          },
          "730740104": {
            "id": "730740104",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Oh, Aradasa is a \"song gatherer\" who collects songs of all kinds. He doesn't like talking. He believes singing is way better.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740105"
            ]
          },
          "730740105": {
            "id": "730740105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... Eh, you do have a point. So, is this one of Ashvattha's Concourses?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740106"
            ]
          },
          "730740106": {
            "id": "730740106",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There aren't any trees here, but there sure are roses... floating in mid-air?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740107"
            ]
          },
          "730740107": {
            "id": "730740107",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "No, it is not. But it is a great discovery nonetheless. Here lies a song that we Aranara have been unable to find for many, many years.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740108"
            ]
          },
          "730740108": {
            "id": "730740108",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Aranara song gatherers always pursue the beauty of songs. At the end of time, they will leave behind a song that belongs only to themselves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740110",
              "730740112"
            ]
          },
          "730740110": {
            "id": "730740110",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Yes! This over here seems to be the song left behind by Arayama. If that's the case, there should be a Vasara Tree nearby.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740113"
            ]
          },
          "730740113": {
            "id": "730740113",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon remembers Araja saying something about the Vasara Trees... Let Paimon check the Aranyaka real quick...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740114"
            ]
          },
          "730740114": {
            "id": "730740114",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Vasara Trees bear Vasoma Fruits! We should help them, {NICKNAME}!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740115"
            ]
          },
          "730740115": {
            "id": "730740115",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Thank you! The song is hidden among the roses. But Arayasa and I have looked for hours and hours, and we couldn't find it. The roses won't talk to us either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740116"
            ]
          },
          "730740116": {
            "id": "730740116",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Paimon sees. {NICKNAME}, let's try having a look, too!"
          },
          "730740112": {
            "id": "730740112",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Thank you, Nara {NICKNAME}! This seems to be the song left by Arayama. If that's the case, there should be a Vasara Tree nearby. We've lucked out!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7307402",
      "subQuestName": "Observe the Sumeru Roses to find the hidden song",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730740201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730740201": {
            "id": "730740201",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Greetings, Nara {NICKNAME}, Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740202"
            ]
          },
          "730740202": {
            "id": "730740202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey there, Arama. Good to see you again! Who's the Aranara with you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740203"
            ]
          },
          "730740203": {
            "id": "730740203",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "♪~",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740204"
            ]
          },
          "730740204": {
            "id": "730740204",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Oh, Aradasa is also a \"song gatherer.\" He doesn't like talking. He believes singing is way better.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740205"
            ]
          },
          "730740205": {
            "id": "730740205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... Eh, you do have a point. Anyway, is there a song hidden here too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740206"
            ]
          },
          "730740206": {
            "id": "730740206",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Yes! Aradasa said Arayama's song has been left here. If that's the case, there should be a Vasara Tree nearby.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740207"
            ]
          },
          "730740207": {
            "id": "730740207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#And where there's a Vasara Tree, there should be a Vasoma Fruit! Let's help them out, {NICKNAME}!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740208"
            ]
          },
          "730740208": {
            "id": "730740208",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Thank you! It's just as before — the song is hidden amongst the roses. Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon are smart. I'm sure you can find it right away!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730740211"
            ]
          },
          "730740211": {
            "id": "730740211",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yep! Leave it to us!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
