    {
      "subId": "7307419",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730741901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730741901": {
            "id": "730741901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We got the third Vasoma Fruit! According to Araja, three Vasoma Fruits should be enough, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741902"
            ]
          },
          "730741902": {
            "id": "730741902",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Yes, that will do. Thank you, Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741904"
            ]
          },
          "730741904": {
            "id": "730741904",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, you were the one helping us throughout, Arama. So why are you thanking us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741906"
            ]
          },
          "730741906": {
            "id": "730741906",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Well... It's because you are helping Arana, and Arana is my friend. So, thank you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741907"
            ]
          },
          "730741907": {
            "id": "730741907",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#And Nara {NICKNAME} has helped Arayasa, Aradasa, and Arasudraka find the ancient songs. They're my friends too. Thank you for that, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741908"
            ]
          },
          "730741908": {
            "id": "730741908",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Finally, I'm so happy that I got to go on adventures with Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon. So, thanks for that as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741909"
            ]
          },
          "730741909": {
            "id": "730741909",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon had a good time too! Thank you, Arama!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741910"
            ]
          },
          "730741910": {
            "id": "730741910",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Speaking of which, Ashvattha's Concourses looked a lot like ancient ruins... Is there a story behind that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741911"
            ]
          },
          "730741911": {
            "id": "730741911",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "That's a story from long, long ago. I wasn't even a seed then. It was a time when all Nara could see Aranara and not a single Aranara was afraid of Nara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741912"
            ]
          },
          "730741912": {
            "id": "730741912",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Back then, Nara and Aranara helped each other. They played and sang together, just like Nara {NICKNAME} and I.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741913"
            ]
          },
          "730741913": {
            "id": "730741913",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Song gatherers like Arayasa originally learned their craft from Nara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741914"
            ]
          },
          "730741914": {
            "id": "730741914",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Ashvattha's Concourses used to be where Nara and Aranara played together. But that was a long time ago.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741915"
            ]
          },
          "730741915": {
            "id": "730741915",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "After the horrible, horrible catastrophe occurred, Vanarana was devastated, and the concourses were left desolate...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741916"
            ]
          },
          "730741916": {
            "id": "730741916",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So that's what happened...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741917"
            ]
          },
          "730741917": {
            "id": "730741917",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Yes, and it's a very scary tale indeed. I'm lucky that they are not memories to me — only stories.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730741918"
            ]
          },
          "730741918": {
            "id": "730741918",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Don't worry! Things will get better. Right, {NICKNAME}?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
